":15,"commission_lane":["venue","guide"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"band+lane","si_raw":"Global Adventures / Backcountry","si_map_basis":"normalised from free text ''Global Adventures / Backcountry'' by gen_normalise_jewel_si","si_basis":"the dossier''s own SI block filed this jewel under a heading resolving to ''wellness'' via ruled RULES. Not a keyword match on the jewel text."}],"faq":[{"q":"When is the best time to visit Deer Valley?","a":"**The biggest expansion in ski history:** the **\"Expanded Excellence\"** integration of the Mayflower ski area has \"more than doubled\" the mountain since December 2024, adding **11 new chairlifts and ~100 new runs** and a new **East Village base** (Keetley Express, Revelator, Park Peak lifts).","source":"https://expandedexcellence.deervalley.com/","accessed":"2026-07-18"},{"q":"How do I get to Deer Valley?","a":"**The terrain in numbers:** post-integration figures give **~4,300 skiable acres** (from an original 2,026), **202 trails**, **~36 lifts**, base **6,530 ft** / summit **9,570 ft** (**3,040 ft vertical**), longest run 4.8 miles; the resort''s stated target is **4,500 acres for 2026-27**.","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deer_Valley","accessed":"2026-07-18"},{"q":"What is worth doing in Deer Valley?","a":"Ski a skier-only mountain with capped crowds. No snowboards and a daily lift-ticket cap mean immaculate corduroy and short lines — the antidote to a crowded holiday week. Bookable: pre-bought lift + ski school.","source":"https://www.deervalley.com/plan-your-trip/tickets-and-passes","accessed":"2026-07-18"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Deer Valley Ski Guide: America''s Ski-Only Luxury Resort, Utah","meta_description":"Plan Deer Valley, Utah - America''s ski-only luxury resort on the Ikon Pass: capped crowds, flawless grooming, on-mountain fine dining, Forbes Five-Star lodging (Stein Eriksen, St. Regis), the record-setting Expanded Excellence / East Village expansion, and Olympic freestyle herita