  ('heavenly-california', '12A', 'Heavenly (South Lake Tahoe)', 'United States', 'Ski a lake-view giant that straddles two states', 'live', 'verified', 'northernLights', 'Central Coast & the Sierra', '{"adventure","culinary","entertainment","expedition","family","romance","ski","wellness"}', '{}', '{"essential","comfort","premier","luxury","ultra"}', null, 'emerging', '{"key_facts":["Heavenly = Vail Resorts / Epic (since 2002); the one major resort that STRADDLES the California-Nevada state line (El Dorado + Alpine counties CA / Douglas County NV) above South Lake Tahoe","4,800 acres, 3,812 ft vertical (base 6,255 / summit 10,067); 97 trails (20% easier / 45% more difficult / 35% most difficult); 25 lifts incl a gondola + aerial tram + 2 six-packs + 8 HS quads; ~360 in snow; no night skiing","The Heavenly Gondola rises from Heavenly Village in downtown South Lake Tahoe; overlooks Lake Tahoe - the largest alpine lake in North America (6,225 ft surface, 1,645 ft deep, 2nd-deepest US lake)","STATELINE, NEVADA casinos at the base (unique ski-and-casino combo): Bally''s Lake Tahoe, Caesars Republic Lake Tahoe (ex-Harveys, rebranded Jul 2025), Golden Nugget Lake Tahoe (ex-Hard Rock, 2023), Harrah''s Lake Tahoe","US-TRAFFIC CANDOR: among Tahoe''s most-visited but Vail reports visitation only in aggregate - no per-resort count published - consensus only","RNO ~55-60 mi / ~70 min (verify); Sacramento ~100 mi / ~2 hr via US-50; a dual-peak market (winter ski + big summer lake season)","NO on-site cat/heli (lift-served only; regional guided touring); NO natural hot springs at Heavenly (Grover Hot Springs, Markleeville ~35-45 min day-trip); Epic/lift prices dynamic","Nearest natural springs = Grover Hot Springs State Park (148F springs, 102-104F pool); Ritz-Carlton Lake Tahoe is at Northstar (separate resort), NOT Heavenly"],"safety":{"emergency":"911 (police/fire/medical/rescue dispatch); alert ski patrol on-mountain","hospital":"Barton Memorial Hospital, South Lake Tahoe CA - local acute-care hospital, 24/7 ER (details 403''d - verify)","malaria":"none","yellow_fever":"not required","activity_note":"ALTITUDE (base 6,255 ft, summit 10,067 ft - summit tops 10,000; hydrate, ease alcohol [note the casinos], descend if AMS worsens); AVALANCHE backcountry - Sierra Avalanche Center (SAC), Central Sierra Nevada (Yuba Pass to Ebbetts Pass incl greater Tahoe basin + Carson Range above Heavenly) - VERIFY exact sub-zone; beacon/probe/shovel + guide, never duck ropes; tree-wells + Sierra-cement deep snow; cold + intense UV off snow/lake; US-50 over Echo Summit (7,382 ft) winter driving + Caltrans chain control (NDOT on the NV side)","fcdo":{"posture":"1","quotes":[],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/usa","read":"2026-09-01T16:18:24Z","page_updated":"2026-08-18T10:29:04+01:00","source_country":"usa","quotes_note":"not extracted by the join — a restricted-area clause is quoted by a human, never composed"},"posture":"book-freely"},"timing":{"peak":"High winter (Christmas/NY, MLK, Presidents'' Week, Feb-Mar) + a second SUMMER peak (Jul-Aug lake season); Stateline swells in both","shoulder":"late Apr-May (post-ski/pre-summer) + Sep-Oct (post-summer/pre-ski)","green":"late-spring + late-fall lulls between the two peaks","booking_lead":"Christmas/NY + Presidents'' + casino-resort peak 3-6 mo (holidays longer); regular winter 2-4 mo; Epic by early fall","off_season_specials":"spring skiing + full summer lake season (beaches/boating/hiking) + casino nightlife year-round + midweek value","event_peaks":"Christmas/NY, MLK + Presidents'', spring break; summer lakefront concerts + casino showroom acts (verify)","fire_date":"FIRE spring early-bird (Apr-Jun) Epic renewals + summer-lake pre-book; fire winter again Sep-Nov"},"jewels":[{"name":"Ski across two states in a day","status":"live","tier":"comfort","price_band":"window dynamic; package best value","timing":"ski Nov-Apr","draw_rank":1,"hook":"Heavenly''s terrain crosses the California–Nevada lin